API relay
---------

The relay Faber generates for a project (packages/device-net/src/relay/: relay-core.mjs,
node-server.mjs, worker.mjs, firmware/FaberRelay.h; written to relay/ in a project, the
factory pack and the build kit) is released under the MIT License so people can deploy
and change it freely. FaberRelay.h embeds public root CA certificates (ISRG Root X1 / X2,
GTS Root R1 / R4, GlobalSign Root CA) for HTTPS trust.
